              "en": "My grandpa was a fisherman in San Felipe."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Fuimos== a la playa en bici.",
              "en": "We went to the beach by bike."
            },
            {
              "es": "El torneo ==fue== en Mexicali.",
              "en": "The tournament was (took place) in Mexicali."
            },
            {
              "es": "Mis amigos ==fueron== a San Diego el fin de semana.",
